Data.DatabaseSchemes:
```sql
CREATE TABLE Users (
    UserId UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    Email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    CreatedAt TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

CREATE TABLE PageContent (
    ContentId UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    PagePath VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    HtmlContent TEXT NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE Interactions (
    InteractionId UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    UserId UUID REFERENCES Users(UserId),
    PagePath VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    InteractionType VARCHAR(50),
    Timestamp TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);
```

Storage Technology Summary: Relational database (e.g., PostgreSQL, Azure SQL Database, AWS RDS for PostgreSQL, GCP Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL) for structured data, offering strong consistency and transactional integrity.
